1..15
ok 1 - event_trigger__disable() disables the default trigger
ok 2 - zzz__object_reference_drop is disabled while a call is in effect
ok 3 - event_trigger__enable() re-enables it
ok 4 - zzz__object_reference_drop is back to its original (origin) state
